  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Program for the Southwest Region of the State of Tocantins</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo de la Regin Sur-Occidental del Estado de Tocantins</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Programa apoyar la expansin de la produccin agropecuaria y agroindustrial, el empleo y el ingreso rural a travs del desarrollo de la infraestructura de riego y drenaje, infraestructura bsica (vas, electricidad, agua potable, vivienda) y servicios como educacin y fortalecimiento institucional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program tries to support the expansion of agricultural and agribusiness production, rural employment and income through the development of irrigation and drainage infrastructure, basic infrastructure (roads, electricity, potable water, housing) and complementary services (education, institutional development).</narrative>
  </description>
